title: XenServer / XCP-ng: Updates
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors the update state of a XenServer 8 host: {WARN}
 (configurable) if the latest synchronized updates are not applied, if
 pending guidances (e.g. RebootHost, RestartToolstack) exist or updates
 require a reboot, and if the last update synchronization is older than the
 configured age (default 8/15 days). Data comes from the special agent
 {agent_xenserver}.

discovery:
 One service {XenServer Updates} per host that reports update information (XenServer 8).
